%% Phase1 / schedule / MV3-G04c 编辑定时消息（cancel + recreate）
%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/angular/visual/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/schedule/mv3-g04c/contract.json
%% UI owners: packages/message/src/lib/services/messageContainerShared.service.ts:1；src/app/message-host/runtime/im-gate/helix/helixTauriImGate.service.ts:1（实际命令与关联回灌）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant PS as Pending or local state
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员点定时提示条进入编辑，改完内容或时间保存，待发消息按新内容更新；取消编辑则原待发消息完整恢复
  Note over UI,Web: 合同登记快照（不等于当前实现或实测）：mock=partial；helix=full；dual=no；personaLocal=yes；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: cancelSchedule + createSchedule(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_cancel_schedule + im_create_schedule", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_cancel_schedule + im_create_schedule", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_cancel_schedule + im_create_schedule", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 修改待发定时消息内容或时间 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/cancelSchedule + POST /posts/createSchedule
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction schedule + channel + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（im:channel:schedule-canceled，im:channel:schedule-created）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ 原始事件 → adapter 映射 kind → Angular 消费
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：编辑保存后待发对象为新内容 / 新时间；hasSchedulePost 最终回到 true；取消编辑必须由 restoreScheduleMessage 把原条重建回去（hasSchedulePost 回到 true，内容与时间与编辑前一致）；编辑态若原消息带回复，走 getScheduleReplyMessage → getPosts([replyId]) 恢复引用条；接收者侧 events 为空、无状态变化（persona-local，不传播）
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：定时未到不得产生 postReceived（待发消息不进时间线）；不得更新 channel.lastPost / lastPostAt / unreadCount（待发消息不参与会话摘要与未读，语义只由 hasSchedulePost 承载）；不得假设存在 update 语义：必须严格 cancel + create 两步（顺序不可颠倒，cancel 失败必须阻止进入编辑）
  Note over E,Sink: 原始事件名（按触发分支）：im:channel:schedule-canceled，im:channel:schedule-created；客户端 kind/action 由 adapter 映射，不是原始 Emit 名称
